{"parentUuid":"7bf62810-02d0-48ec-8466-11694f199607","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"qwen3.7-plus","id":"msg_a5b0eb5d-c5dc-46a2-ba73-7fc499a1e0b9","role":"assistant","type":"message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好，Obsidian 不写了。\n\n## 总结\n\n**问题已修复** ✅\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|---|---|\n| **现象** | 持仓池体检14只股票全部 \"❌失败\"，名称/价格/涨跌全空 |\n| **根因** | `data_layer.py` 第437行 `get_intraday()` 调用 `_cache_get(cache_key, max_age=...)` 但函数参数名是 `ttl_seconds`，关键字参数不匹配 → `TypeError` |\n| **传播链** | `diagnose()` → `analyze_intraday()` → `dl.get_intraday()` → `_cache_get(max_age=...)` 💥 TypeError → 外层 `except` 吞掉错误 → 渲染显示 \"❌失败\" |\n| **为什么其他步骤正常** | 美股/美债/大盘/事件用的是不同的数据接口（`get_us_market`, `get_index_daily` 等），不经过 `get_intraday()` |\n| **修复** | `max_age=` → `ttl_seconds=`，一行改动 |\n| **教训** | `collect_watchlist()` 的 except 把错误详情吞了，markdown 渲染也不显示 error。建议后续给汇总表加一列显示失败原因，方便排查 |\n\n**为什么之前能跑现在不行了？** 大概率是最近某次更新 `get_intraday()` 时加了缓存逻辑（v0.93 盘中缓存4h），写成了 `max_age=` 但 `_cache_get` 的参数一直是 `ttl_seconds`，属于参数名拼写错误。"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":499,"cache_read_input_tokens":107565,"output_tokens":413,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":499},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"attributionSkill":"claude-stock","type":"assistant","uuid":"cdf3531e-7b40-44dd-ba81-39cbbdea0937","timestamp":"2026-08-14T01:28:17.256Z","effort":"high","session_id":"df33713e-6c00-4d1f-af2a-9d28a323194c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"E:\\playgroud","sessionId":"df33713e-6c00-4d1f-af2a-9d28a323194c","version":"2.1.229","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"concurrent-brewing-kay"}
